    "northStar": "The Team Under One Roof",
    "overview": "The home page is a drenched petrol-to-teal panel on a pale cool ground, with white rounded cards laid over it. Real doctor portraits are the only imagery; one green is spent on numerals, rules, step markers and focus. Depth comes from tonal layering plus a single soft negative-spread shadow.",
